d technical documents in academia and industry.&#10;Among its many packages, the one I have been most absorbed in lately is TikZ, a versatile package for drawing detailed, publication-quality diagrams.&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://yangyangli.top/latex/020-tikz-learn-jouney/featured.jpg"/></item></channel></rss>